# D3-MI-003: A sulfate background and an ionic-strength control affect gypsum differently
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 gypsum 0.002mol
add v1 Na2SO4 0.001mol
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 gypsum 0.002mol
add v2 NaCl 0.002mol
add v3 water 50mL
add v3 gypsum 0.002mol
stir v1 300rpm 10s
stir v2 300rpm 10s
stir v3 300rpm 10s
look v1
look v2
look v3
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
